/-!
# The zero scheme of a section and its ideal-power quotients on a chart `X_a`

Let `L` be an ample invertible module on `X`, `A = Γ_*(X, L)` its section ring, `s` a global
section of `L` with image `f ∈ A₁`, and `a ∈ A_d` homogeneous with `X_a` affine. Suppose that `a`
has a degree-one factor, `a = t c` with `t ∈ A₁`; then `t` trivializes `L` on `X_a`. This file
computes, on the chart `X_a`:

* the ideal of the zero scheme `Z(s)`: it is generated by the single function `f c / a`, the
  section `s` divided by the trivialization `t`;
* the kernel of the projection `L^{⊗ m} ⟶ L^{⊗ m} / Z(s)^{n+1} L^{⊗ m}` on sections over `X_a`:
  it consists of the multiples of `(f c / a)^{n+1}`; and
* the comparison with the section ring: under the chart identification
  `Γ(X_a, L^{⊗ m}) ≅ (A_a)_m` of `Stacks.Algebraization.SectionRingCone.chartSectionsEquiv`, a
  section dies in the quotient exactly when its image dies in `(A / f^{n+1} A)_a`.

## Main results

* `Stacks.Algebraization.SectionRingCone.zeroScheme_ideal_chart` — the ideal of `Z(s)` on `X_a`.
* `Stacks.Algebraization.SectionRingCone.idealPowerQuotient_app_eq_zero_iff_chart` — the kernel
  of the quotient projection on `X_a`.
* `Stacks.Algebraization.SectionRingCone.chartQuotientReduction_eq_zero_iff` — that kernel read in
  `(A / f^{n+1} A)_a`.
-/

@[expose] public noncomputable section

open AlgebraicGeometry CategoryTheory CategoryTheory.Limits MonoidalCategory Opposite
  TopologicalSpace
open Stacks.TensorPowers (natTensorPow)
open Stacks.GradedSections (powSections sectionRing)
open Stacks.AmpleFiniteAvoidance (nvOpen grading)
open AlgebraicGeometry.ProjectiveSpectrum.Proj (integerGrading)
open Stacks.SectionRingProjQuasicoherent (unitSec)

open Deformation.Artin.SectionsSheaf (modulesHom_app_presheaf_map)

attribute [local instance] instVAddNatIntGradedLocalizedModule

attribute [local instance] Stacks.SheafOfModules.monoidalCategoryPresheafOfModules
  Stacks.SheafOfModules.symmetricCategoryPresheafOfModules
  Stacks.SheafInternalHom.isMonoidal_localIso
  Stacks.SheafInternalHom.isLocalization_sheafify Stacks.SheafInternalHom.monoidalCategory
  Stacks.SheafInternalHom.sheafifyMonoidal Stacks.SheafInternalHom.braidedCategory
  Stacks.SheafInternalHom.schemeMonoidalCategory
  Stacks.SectionRingGeometric.schemeBraidedCategory
  Stacks.SectionRingGeometric.schemePreadditive
  Stacks.SectionRingGeometric.schemeTensorRightAdditive

